Integer coefficients for the element routines in this addon.

List of the coefficients
------------------------

  1-150: all relevant integer coefficients from the stokes & viscoelastic add-on

151 Time integration scheme:
    0: default (=1)
    1: first-order, implicit Euler
    2: second-order, implicit Gear (BDF2)
    NOTE: this only applies to the element routine diffuse_interface_elem1
    and not to the classical routine diffuse_interface_elem, which remains
    first-order, no ALE and no tALE.

152 Iteration scheme for the nonlinear terms in the diffuse-interface equations
    0: default (=1)
    1: Picard
    2: Newton-Raphson
    NOTE: if the explicit/implicit time integration scheme is used, this only
    applies to the element routine diffuse_interface_elem1 and not to the 
    classical routine diffuse_interface_elem, which remains Picard.
    NOTE2: if the fully implicit time integration is used, this applies to
    the routines for the non-linear cross terms as well (surface tension, 
    convection)

153 velocity to use in the convection term of the DI equation
    0: default (=1)
    1: prediction uhat=un (1st order) or uhat=2un-unm1 (2nd order)
    2: velocity from previous iteration step (u_i)
    NOTE: this coefficient only applies to diffuse_interface_elem1
    NOTE2: since the fully implicit time integration scheme is not implemented
    for tALE, this coefficient has to be 0 or 1 if tALE is used

154-200: Reserved for future use. Set to zero for future compatibility.
